 ARCHITECTURE NOTES (binding decisions)
================================================================================
 * Data: the manifest classifies this page as "no first-party API data source"
   (renders from navigation values / local state). The model binds an injectable
   `ApiLogsSource` seam; `InMemoryApiLogsSource` drives previews/tests; the app wires
   the live /api-logs + /api-logs/stats reads later. No fabricated KMP endpoint.
 * SI: the page renders counts / milliseconds / a percentage only — no physical
   quantities — so no SI conversion applies (parity with the web, which renders
   these verbatim). The display boundary is honored; nothing non-SI is stored.
 * i18n: per-surface "ApiLogsPage" .strings table resolved via NSLocalizedString,
   mirroring the sibling AcDcStatsPanel convention; folds into Localizable.xcstrings
   at integration. Components taking LocalizedStringKey get the pre-resolved English
   via ApiLogsStrings.key(). Zero hardcoded visible literals in the Swift sources.
 * Freshness (ADR-013): a live/stale/offline connection axis → header chip + banner
   + one-shot auto-refresh on the stale transition (this page is not SSE-backed).
 * a11y (ADR-015): VoiceOver labels/traits on header, stat cards, chips, filters,
   rows (composed spoken label + expand/collapse hint), banners; Dynamic Type system
   fonts (Font.TS); >=44pt targets via shared TSButton; light/dark via tokens.

